{"text": "nourishment", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">norisshement</i>, from Middle French, from Old French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">norissement</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">norrir</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "The act of nourishing or the state of being nourished", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "Something that nourishes; food", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["Received Pronunciation, New York City", "/\u02c8n\u028c\u0279\u026a\u0283m\u0259nt/"], ["General American", "/\u02c8n\u025d\u026a\u0283m\u0259nt/"]]}